OL,3,AFamilies fly to Nepal in search for 33
OL,4,Amissing British nationals
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies of missing UK nationals have
OL,7,Fflown out to Nepal to search for their
OL,8,Frelatives.
OL,10,FThe death toll from the floods in Nepal
OL,11,Fand Tibet has risen to at least 475,
OL,12,Fwith several hundred people missing,
OL,13,Fincluding 537 tourists.
OL,15,FAmong the British nationals reported
OL,16,Fmissing are a 13-year-old girl and
OL,17,F14-year-old boy. On Friday, Nepalese
OL,18,Fauthorities released a list of the
OL,19,Fnames of all known missing tourists, 33
OL,20,Fof which are British nationals.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
