OL,3,A18 deaths from battery fires show
OL,4,Ahidden danger of UK's e-bike boom
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 2,000 fires were started by
OL,7,Fe-bikes, e-scooters or their batteries
OL,8,Fbetween 2019 and 2025, Freedom of
OL,9,FInformation requests made by BBC Verify
OL,10,Fshow.
OL,12,FThe number of incidents has risen
OL,13,Fyear-on-year and nearly half the fires
OL,14,Fstarted in homes or garages, the data
OL,15,Fshows.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
