OL,3,A'High risk' of lake breaching and
OL,4,Acausing second flood, warns China
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina has warned there is a "high risk"
OL,7,Fthat a lake which formed after the
OL,8,Frecent landslide near the Nepal-Tibet
OL,9,Fborder may breach its banks, causing a
OL,10,Fsecond flood downstream.
OL,12,FThe warning comes after Wednesday's
OL,13,Fdeadly flash flood in the same area
OL,14,Fwhich scientists say was triggered by
OL,15,Fthe collapse of a mountain glacier into
OL,16,Fa river.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
