OL,3,A'High risk' of lake breaching and
OL,4,Acausing second flood, warns China
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs of Friday, an estimated 2.5 million
OL,7,Fcubic metres of water had accumulated
OL,8,Fat the barrier lake, according to state
OL,9,Fbroadcaster CCTV. A barrier lake is a
OL,10,Fbody of water formed when debris dams
OL,11,Fup a river.
OL,13,FOfficials said that three million cubic
OL,14,Fmetres of water is expected to flow
OL,15,Finto the lake between Thursday and the
OL,16,Fweekend, posing a "high risk of
OL,17,Fbreach".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
